MATRIX: Euclidean algorithm, least common multiple, and a reduced fraction.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE gcd WITH a AND b
  IF a IS LESS THAN 0 THEN
    BUGATTI a EQUALS MINUS a
  PERIOD
  IF b IS LESS THAN 0 THEN
    BUGATTI b EQUALS MINUS b
  PERIOD
  GRIND WHILE b IS NOT THE SAME AS 0
    BUGATTI r EQUALS a MODULO b
    BUGATTI a EQUALS b
    BUGATTI b EQUALS r
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT a
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE lcm WITH a AND b
  CASH OUT CALL floor WITH (a DIVIDED BY CALL gcd WITH a AND b) TIMES b
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI left EQUALS 84
BUGATTI right EQUALS 126
BUGATTI g EQUALS CALL gcd WITH left AND right

WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "gcd(" PLUS left PLUS ", " PLUS right PLUS ") = " PLUS g
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "lcm(" PLUS left PLUS ", " PLUS right PLUS ") = " PLUS CALL lcm WITH left AND right
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI left DIVIDED BY g PLUS "/" PLUS right DIVIDED BY g

IF CALL gcd WITH 17 AND 19 IS THE SAME AS 1 THEN
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "17 and 19 are coprime."
PERIOD

BACK TO THE MATRIX
